{"id":"wb-6-300","name":"德胜门箭楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"德胜门 (北京)","text":"德胜门，是明清北京城内城北城墙西侧的城门，始建于明朝洪武四年（1371年），正统年间得以扩建，规模最大时有城楼、箭楼、瓮城和闸楼等部分，瓮城内还建有真武庙等建筑。自1915年起，德胜门的城楼、瓮城等部分被陆续拆除，至20世纪60年代仅余箭楼，现存的德胜门箭楼位于中华人民共和国北京市德胜门桥南侧。2006年，德胜门箭楼被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BE%B7%E8%83%9C%E9%97%A8_(%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC)","revisionId":89467072,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89467072","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9f6bc51747d41896870cd4a3.jpg","title":"Deshengmen_Northeast_View2022.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Deshengmen_Northeast_View2022.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/Deshengmen_Northeast_View2022.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Charlie fong","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​北京德胜门，东北方向视角","width":320,"height":180}}